SUMMARY:Oxford Historical Society Presentation - "Flight Lieutenant Oliver Brock Robertson "
DESCRIPTION:Come join Bob Van Wyk as he recounts the history of Flt. Lt. Oliver Brock Robertson\, DFC and his amazing crew and their heroic missions in honour of their memories and service on Remembrance Day and everyday!
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/oxford-historical-society-presentation-flight-lieutenant-oliver-brock-robertson/
LOCATION:Chartwell Oxford Gardens\, 423 Devonshire Ave\, Woodstock\, Ontario\, Canada
ORGANIZER;CN="Oxford Historical Society":MAILTO:info@oxhs.ca
END:VEVENT
